" NPU) are exposed through the :doc:`/library/omv.ml` module. Models stored "
"on the read‑only ``/rom`` filesystem load directly from flash without "
"copying to RAM, so even large detectors fit comfortably alongside the live "
"framebuffer. Run a YOLOv8 detector on every frame and draw the predictions "
